### 1. Root / Directory
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### 3. Validate Phone Number
POST http://localhost:3000/api/phone/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+12025550143"
}

### 4. Send Phone OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/api/phone/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+12025550143"
}

### 5. Check Active OTPs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/phone/active-otps

### 6. Verify Phone OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/api/phone/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+12025550143",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 7. Validate Email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/email/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@example.com"
}

### 8. Send Email Verification Link
POST http://localhost:3000/api/email/send-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@example.com"
}

### 9. Send Custom Email Message
POST http://localhost:3000/api/email/send-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "tester@example.com",
  "subject": "Testing Email Route",
  "body": "Hello, this is a test message from Express!"
}

### 10. List Users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### 11. Create User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone": "+12025550177"
}

### 12. Echo Test
POST http://localhost:3000/api/test/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testing": true,
  "foo": "bar"
}

### 13. Delayed Response (Timeout Test)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/delay/1000

### 14. Custom HTTP Status Code
GET http://localhost:3000/api/test/status/401
